 "titulo": "You built a bridge over a creek 🌉 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A BRIDGE",
 "descripcion": "A log, planks, a pier, a stone arch and a steel truss: how a simple creek crossing becomes a real bridge, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #bridge #construction #howitworks #shorts",
